{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本人氣前AV女優濱崎真緒今晚正式殺入HOY TV處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》，首度挑戰全廣東話破格演出！劇中角 …</p><p></p>\n<p>日本人氣前AV女優濱崎真緒今晚正式殺入HOY TV處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》，首度挑戰全廣東話破格演出！劇中角色麥峰為了查探這位神秘新住客底細，不惜瞞住陳小姐上演連場極致誘惑戲碼。</p>\n<h2>麥沛東暗查濱崎真緒險墮溫柔鄉</h2>\n<p>今晚播映第10集《幸福の崎遇》情節迎來前所未有高潮，神秘新住客濱崎真緒自帶強大氣場與性感低胸造型進駐大廈。劇中保安員麥峰（麥沛東）即使有邱副苦口婆心勸阻，依然無法按捺好奇心，決定暗中對這位夢幻女神展開全方位背景調查。兩人在大廈內每一次交鋒都充滿火花與試探，麥峰在抗拒視覺衝擊與心理防線崩潰邊緣掙扎，同時更要煞費苦心向陳小姐掩飾自己這段不可告人秘密行程。</p>\n<h2>濱崎真緒親自落場回覆拋震撼彈</h2>\n<p>對於首次參與香港電視台處境劇拍攝，濱崎真緒親自在社交平台與一眾狂熱粉絲互動交心。她坦言面對全廣東話對白這項艱巨任務感到壓力巨大，並留言表示「很緊張很緊張」，懇求觀眾能夠包容及欣賞她為角色付出諸多心血。為答謝粉絲鼎力支持並進一步炒熱氣氛，她語出驚人地許下重磅承諾，直指若果該集影片在YouTube平台上突破200萬點擊率關口，「我想導演不介意裸跑」。</p>\n<h2>處境喜劇李寶安力求突破傳統</h2>\n<p>HOY TV全新處境喜劇《你的保安李寶安》自開播以來不斷嘗試為觀眾帶來新鮮感，製作團隊特意安排濱崎真緒在劇中以本色出演AV女優身份登場，巧妙地將現實與虛構劇情融合，藉此打破傳統處境喜劇既有框架。</p>\n<h2>網民群情洶湧強烈要求加碼演出</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾看完預告及播出片段後紛紛湧入討論區瘋狂洗版，對這集破格內容給予極高評價。有忠實擁躉直指麥峰成為全劇最幸福角色，留言大讚「麥峰今集開心啦，被兩個女神圍住」，並有大量聲音「強烈要求濱崎真緒再出多幾集！」、「今集可以重溫n次」，甚至有人搞笑宣稱「我堂堂正正光明正大喺客廳開大聲睇濱崎真緒」。</p>\n<p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431942978346954_18171935756af32448b57e2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 今晚播映第10集《幸福の崎遇》情節迎來前所未有高潮，神秘新住客濱崎真緒自帶強大氣場與性感低胸造型進駐大廈。（圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431942978346954_18171935756af32448b57e2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>今晚播映第10集《幸福の崎遇》情節迎來前所未有高潮，神秘新住客濱崎真緒自帶強大氣場與性感低胸造型進駐大廈。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431943654350911_20614865456af3244e31ded.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 兩人在大廈內每一次交鋒都充滿火花與試探（圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431943654350911_20614865456af3244e31ded.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人在大廈內每一次交鋒都充滿火花與試探（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431944147930842_14582046476af324530f820.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 濱崎真緒面對全廣東話對白這項艱巨任務感到壓力巨大，並留言表示「很緊張很緊張」（圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431944147930842_14582046476af324530f820.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>濱崎真緒面對全廣東話對白這項艱巨任務感到壓力巨大，並留言表示「很緊張很緊張」（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431944819613938_15473968316af32459ce455.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 （圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431944819613938_15473968316af32459ce455.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431945282850407_5897544996af3245e55650.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 （圖片來源HOY：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431945282850407_5897544996af3245e55650.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源HOY：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431945747325731_12076944946af324632248d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 （圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431945747325731_12076944946af324632248d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431946203588147_16784162286af324679ca29.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 黃金畫面！（圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431946203588147_16784162286af324679ca29.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黃金畫面！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431946720481098_9233585556af3246d0154b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 （圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431946720481098_9233585556af3246d0154b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431947185857168_4362555556af32471a56e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"你的保安李寶安 濱崎真緒 （圖片來源：HOY）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179431947185857168_4362555556af32471a56e8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%a0%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%9d%e5%ae%89%e6%9d%8e%e5%af%b6%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你的保安李寶安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%bf%b1%e5%b4%8e%e7%9c%9f%e7%b7%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">濱崎真緒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%99%95%e5%a2%83%e5%96%9c%e5%8a%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">處境喜劇</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：HOY資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3539920\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 10 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:23:41.950807+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1343,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:04:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:17:14.635709+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T16:17:14.635709+00:00","content_hash":"62f6af9826217d6b9af08171571886c8641f4450d3987f8ea1541f21639b51e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}